    },
    {
        "text": "Put our boys and girls in every shop on this street and the next ones over. Everyone keeps an eye out. We are NOT letting her run away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cautious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_runstop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just got news from North Street, boss! She's heading this way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your eyes on her! Don't let her run off!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't think she's trying to hide, boss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Get everyone back here, pronto!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
