        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In the narrow alleyway, a gang of ghoulish thugs surrounds the girl with the bass guitar case."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We meet again... Umiri.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, and here I was wondering why a pro like you never got taken in by any famiglie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "text": "See, after ours fell on hard times, I asked around, and that's how I learned you made your career out of being a traitor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've gone through a dozen names bouncing around every famiglia out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our contracts never said we couldn't do work for others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "And like I said long ago: I only take my reward and fulfill the duties that match it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 12,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that why you sold our secrets to our enemies?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't know what you're talking about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't play dumb, you goddamn traitor! Ever since you showed up, our people have been getting screwed left and right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "text": "All thanks to me and the don being stupid enough to trust you. We even invited you to join us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Francis, I don't remember what I've done to offend you all\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. What, you owe so many people you can't even remember?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "The don's dead, everyone's dead! We had hundreds of people, and now it's just our dozen left!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We busted our asses moving from Columbia to this stupid place, but you had to go and get everyone killed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No more talk. There's enough of us here to teach her a very painful lesson today!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to have to fight with you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri tries to stay the impending clash through words, but the gang shows no signs of relenting as they approach her\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "She is forced to put her case down."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright... let's get her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
