    {
        "text": "I wouldn't go any further, now, bambina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Old Lady"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something just started up over there. You're not safe alone. Go the long way round, quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kind Old Lady"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thank you for the warning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behatted Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl pays the passerby's advice no heed. She continues on in the exact direction she was warned against."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
