    },
    {
        "text": "The billiards room of a casino. Nobody would expect someone to live here."
    },
    {
        "text": "A few cardboard boxes are assembled into a makeshift bed. The most basic of toiletries fill a bag nabbed for free from a fast food joint."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openenvelope_slow",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_coin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_coin",
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "coin2",
        "delay": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "The billiards table is covered in envelopes, envelopes containing Umiri's payment."
    },
    {
        "text": "She opens them up one after the other, tossing the golden coins within onto the table. Soon, the pile of coins stamped with 'Famiglia' and 'Ordine' has become a miniature mountain."
    },
    {
        "text": "And there the coins are left, out in the open, without the slightest protection. She wouldn't care the slightest bit if they went missing."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_papertear",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri checks over the envelope in her hand once more. There is nothing in it."
    },
    {
        "text": "She flips it over. On its front is the insignia of a famiglia, along with the sender's address."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
