        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's here, boss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walk_stage",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "nw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "channel": "nw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The guys in the prison didn't give you any trouble, did they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#11$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're all old friends. Besides, they know who my employer is. They wouldn't want to stick their hands in the fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I imagine you didn't summon me just to ask that, did you, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kheheh. Just concerned for a business partner, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, when did we become partners?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you signed your contract with me, you wouldn't even use your famiglia's name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, if you want to become 'partners', and I know you do, then let me lay my cards out\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri, I'd like to have you for a long-term job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of job requires us to meet face-to-face?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm thinking... of inviting you into the famiglia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#6$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... did you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
