    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nobody inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_runstop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you insist on coming along? You're obviously afraid of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not a mafioso, you wouldn't get it! I gotta... I gotta get revenge, for everyone's sake!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly happened between you and Umiri that you find so unforgivable?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you ever got betrayed the way we did, you wouldn't forgive her either...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our famiglia was mostly ordinary folk running away from the Columbian frontier. We didn't have much of a network or resources, so we've always been looked down upon by the local mafia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fast forward a couple of years, and one day, the boss decides to spend a fortune hiring someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that was Umiri?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep. Once we hired her, it was peace and quiet for a long, long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those were the good days. Didn't have to worry about anyone raiding our place, or looking for trouble at our door...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when we invited her to actually join the famiglia, she declined. Then the next day, she vanished. Just, gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "And right as we started getting suspicious, a bunch of goons stormed in to stab us in the gut. No idea who sent them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still can't bear to look back at what happened that day... It was too much, too much!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're under the impression Umiri sold you out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, who else could it be?! You're crazy if you think it's a coincidence!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm not willing to believe that Umiri would betray someone like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Umiri I know is much like you've described. Strong and capable, a reassuring presence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "And always eager to uphold her duty as part of a group.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, but facts are facts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you see any trace of her amongst the people in that raid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I did not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then do you remember what the raiders themselves looked like?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't forget for the rest of my life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko takes a deep breath, moving her hand to the self-defense weapon in her pocket."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if... someone was deliberately trying to break you apart?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if... someone was keeping a close eye on Umiri this entire time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What're you trying to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
